/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":277,"html":278},"translation","\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7122-2511\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>[— — —], an Akragantine.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":280,"html":281},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The ethnic Ἀκραγαντῖνος is the only securely interpretable element. Daux regarded the text as a dedication rather than an artist's signature and attributed the form of gamma to an Akragantine stonecutter. Bousquet interpreted the holes on the upper bed as settings for at least two bronze statues and at least two stelae, suggesting an elongated base carrying a multi-figure dedication.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":283,"html":284},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Daux 1937 60–61, pl. VII \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Bousquet 1959 150, n. 2 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001375\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001375\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1962 18.0210 \u003C/li>\u003Cli> De Waele 1971 40 no. 9 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002040\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002040\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Dubois 1989 \u003Ca href=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\" target=\"_blank\">182b\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Jeffery and Johnston 1990 278 no. 64 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000678\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000678\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Arena 2002 93 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001373\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001373\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":286,"html":287},"h